[S:A5] verification/lean-mathlib/OIBridge/SubstratumInterfaceAudit.lean:101-102
    /-- **(A5) LINEARITY**: the rule is additive over the alphabet. -/
    def A5 : Prop := ∀ c c' : 𝒮.ι → 𝒮.V, 𝒮.R.F (c + c') = 𝒮.R.F c + 𝒮.R.F c'
